# C-j at a permission question that arrives while `/status` is open
# (APPROVAL-CTRL-J). fx v0.0.16's approval takes a raw byte before any menu
# does (`routeActiveModalInput`, app_input_runtime.zig:1161-1185@481104fd,
# ahead of the MCP menu and the compact menus at :1186-1216; the picker's
# C-j yields to it, :1093-1116), so C-j answers the question, `Apply once`,
# and the panel comes back as it was. The turn is p5-panels-keys.cap's.
fx: gateway p5-panels-keys-turn.json
xfx: gateway p5-panels-keys-turn-xfx.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=ask
wait 2
type run it
key Enter
wait 0.8
type /status
key Enter
wait 0.8
snap open-before-approval
wait 3
snap approval-arrives
key -H 0a
wait 1.5
snap approval-ctrl-j
wait 1
snap end
